# Hero: a long session. Scroll far back while the composer stays pinned, then jump to latest.
Output out/hero.gif
Source common.tape
Hide
Type "./demo-codex.sh resume --last"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Show
Sleep 1.2s
PageUp
Sleep 450ms
PageUp
Sleep 450ms
PageUp
Sleep 450ms
PageUp@40ms 80
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 2.5s
